{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":94199,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2020,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjCv7OiGYPAa6dGntKddGEUYqSC.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1944011","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"六个月前，在边境孙德胜卧底毒贩。被毒贩发现孙德胜身份并带到一个山洞里。沈辣和王队一行人进入去营救孙德胜。在山洞遇见怪物，沈辣用吴仁荻的剑砍掉怪物后，护林人林火对沈辣一行人攻击时吴仁荻出现了。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ikWcDkz7tO27pIKm3OvNJT1xOP0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ikWcDkz7tO27pIKm3OvNJT1xOP0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"2380683","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"吴仁荻让沈辣杀掉林火，沈辣犹豫时，林火向沈辣发起攻击。沈辣向林火开了枪。吴仁荻毁掉了林火的塔取出一个金色骷髅头，随后山洞开始崩塌。沈辣也误吸林火的异能晕了过去。沈辣醒后发现和孙德胜在医院，然后被白露和郝文明带到民调局并加入民调局一室。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/acrnbOSwvjxzX8uVHue766ggozA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/acrnbOSwvjxzX8uVHue766ggozA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"2380684","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"一室和两室的人联合起来去沙漠的遗迹营救考古队和救援队。沈辣在晚上看见一头山羊，孙德胜便跟了过去。两人陷进了流沙遇到了一个小孩的灵魂。小孩对二人发起了攻击，白露出现打跑了小孩的灵魂。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b25Sn9YtQvBjB78yfFSSYu0Diws.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b25Sn9YtQvBjB78yfFSSYu0Diws.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2380685","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"沈辣、孙德胜和白露进入古雉国百节王的陵墓，沈辣用吴仁荻的剑割开定尸铜棺。孙德胜乱碰掉进百节王真正的墓，从墙上的壁画得知定尸铜棺中的人与百节王的关系，在看壁画过程中沈辣中了梦魇。一小时后六室主任吴仁荻在百节王的陵墓中出现。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4IGb9vknSEyCF6VZ12rdNnJr6vM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4IGb9vknSEyCF6VZ12rdNnJr6vM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2380686","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"吴仁荻进入沈辣的幻境救出了他，沈辣按照幻境中的路让四人中了第二个幻境。在第二幻境中选错了路中了第三个幻境。在第三幻境中吴仁荻控制住小孩的灵魂解救了考古队和民调局的人。在返回民调局的路中杨枭混进了里面……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AuKhwamp45x2SDW6iq5wWkZAqxH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AuKhwamp45x2SDW6iq5wWkZAqxH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2380687","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"回到局里欧阳偏左给沈辣和孙德胜检测身体，沈辣的情况被丘不老知道后把沈辣抓走。高亮要求丘不老放掉沈辣并答应让他监督沈辣转正考核。白露特训沈辣和孙德胜两个月后在刘家村完成考核，丘不老要除掉沈辣被高亮阻止。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pG6qjFBvlguOFhzGWGrK3vuLPHY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pG6qjFBvlguOFhzGWGrK3vuLPHY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2380689","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"傀儡抢夺沈辣身上“林火异能”，沈辣、吴仁荻、孙德胜三人入盗梦空间，多层梦境显胖子睿智。昏迷事件调查原因竟是中了古巫术蛊毒，小杨教主身份逐渐展开。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cNLzl96yzRYgMi9b6Ozuc8te2M7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cNLzl96yzRYgMi9b6Ozuc8te2M7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2380690","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"昏迷者中爞毒，身上缠悬印。教主杨枭为救妻子变装露真身，小分队荒楼斗傀儡，吴仁荻加入抢夺圣物地珠。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-18","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y9eoADqWUP35Yq3Q7MKRl1YahYH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y9eoADqWUP35Yq3Q7MKRl1YahYH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2380691","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"陆云设圈套争上位，杨枭救妻心切夺地珠，被迫与吴仁荻交手身负重伤。吴仁荻出手救蓉蓉，一段跨越千年的恩怨，即将了结。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-09-25","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6lAQQuAUsc96m5IB0j27chENCPH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6lAQQuAUsc96m5IB0j27chENCPH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2380692","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"枭加入民调局，一行人来到凌云观接萧道长离开。民调局成员陆续被清除，一个巨大的威胁慢慢浮现，全局陷入危机中。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-10-02","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vBw0BndDTfRoFGoQ0kulxy1GCHa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vBw0BndDTfRoFGoQ0kulxy1GCHa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2380693","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"沈辣一行人遭遇怪物袭击，这些怪物的目的究竟是什么？肖三达蛊惑沈辣并且逼迫萧和尚交出神器天理图，过往秘密也慢慢被揭开……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-10-09","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6kRlkBEg0ywZndg53uOPELMEcn7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6kRlkBEg0ywZndg53uOPELMEcn7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"2380694","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"沈辣冒着被异能吞噬的风险强行觉醒，与肖三达展开殊死战斗。白发沈辣能否破茧重生？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AgZNwRkxbpjwz1EDHcGcxQ2CGen.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AgZNwRkxbpjwz1EDHcGcxQ2CGen.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94199/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793333956599,"status":"ok"}}}
